Using the shop database: Update Sarah's city to "San Francisco": UPDATE customers SET city = 'San Francisco' WHERE first_name = 'Sarah'; Verify the change: SELECT * FROM customers WHERE first_name = 'Sarah'; Increase all Electronics prices by 5%: UPDATE products SET price = price * 1.05 WHERE category = 'Electronics'; Verify: SELECT name, price FROM products WHERE category = 'Electronics'; Insert a test row, then delete it: INSERT INTO customers (first_name, last_name, email) VALUES ('Test', 'User', 'test@email.com');
