184.body:
Find values within a range: -- Products priced between $20 and $50
SELECT name, price FROM products WHERE price BETWEEN 20 AND 50; This is the same as: WHERE price >= 20 AND price <= 50 For dates: -- Orders placed in February 2025
SELECT * FROM orders WHERE order_date BETWEEN '2025-02-01' AND '2025-02-28';

187.body:
Some columns might be empty (NULL). To check for NULL: -- Customers without a phone number
SELECT first_name, last_name FROM customers WHERE phone IS NULL; -- Customers WITH a phone number
SELECT first_name, phone FROM customers WHERE phone IS NOT NULL;

